# Electricity Price Updates

When the user asks to "update prices", "refresh electricity prices", or similar:

1. Read src/utils/prices.ts to see current vendors and plans
2. Use web search to find current fixed (blue) plan pricing for each Greek electricity vendor
3. Focus on: fixedPrice (monthly fee in EUR) and kwhPrice (per kWh rate)
4. Compare findings with existing data
5. Report any changes found (price updates, new plans, discontinued plans)
6. Update prices.ts with user approval

Vendors to check:
- ΔΕΗ (dei.gr) - myHome plans
- ΖΕΝΙΘ (zenith.gr) - Power Home Secure
- Φυσικό Αέριο (fysikoaerioellados.gr) - Home Fixed
- Elpedison (elpedison.gr) - fixed rate plans
- nrg (nrg.gr) - Fixed plans
- Volton (volton.gr) - Blue plans
- ΗΡΩΝ (heron.gr) - Blue Generous plans
- Ελίν (energy.elin.gr) - Power On! Blue plans
- Eunice (eunice-power.gr) - Home plans
- Protergia (protergia.gr) - Value plans

